  "description": "If you’re looking for a great entry-level mountain bike which brags a high-quality frame and components, something that can take you to the trailhead and then onto an adventurous mountain bike ride, then the Ceres SUV-1 is exactly what you need. With it’s 6061 aluminum alloy frame, the 27.5\" wheels and the RST Capa suspension fork, you’ll roll over the most demanding of terrain and you can be confident in quick and powerful stopping power provide by the V-brakes. The 2x8 speed drivetrain will provide you all the gears needed to go up the steepest of slopes and also supply you with the desired torque on the way back down. The Ceres SUV-1 checks all of the boxes to furnish you with a go-anywhere mountain bike that will not let you down.\n\nLightweight Aluminum 6061 Alloy frame delivers all of the power from your pedals to the back wheel through the stiff frame, while being light enough for a quick and responsive ride.\n\nRST Capa 80mm Travel Fork coil sprung with Mechanical Lock-Out\n\nMicroshift A3 2x8 16 speed drivetrain for smooth, precision shifting\n\n27.5\"x 2.20 Duro Tires providing grip on the slickest of terrain",
